<title>USA: General Growth adds seven mall contracts.</title>
<headline>General Growth adds seven mall contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Growth Properties Inc said Thursday its property management subsidiary won seven new contracts to manage regional malls for Cadillac Fairview Corp Ltd.</p>
<p>It will assume management and leasing responsibilities on November 1. The contracts encompass about 5.5 million square feet of space.</p>
<p>The malls are situated in New York, Delaware, North Carolina, Georgia, Mississippi and Louisiana.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
